+/*
+ * darling-lol: minimal but FUNCTIONAL SCDynamicStore.
+ *
+ * Chromium's dns_config_service_posix (macOS) creates an SCDynamicStore,
+ * calls SCDynamicStoreSetNotificationKeys with the DNS/State keys, and
