+	 * dns watcher does SCDynamicStoreCreateRunLoopSource + CFRunLoopAddSource;
+	 * a NULL source left it with nothing to schedule ("watch failed to
+	 * start") and risked a NULL deref/abort downstream. This dummy source
+	 * satisfies scheduling; it never signals because Darling has no configd
+	 * to deliver changes from.
+	 */
